      "romaji": "hibike sekai ni"
    },
    {
      "text": "最高に笑えるように",
      "romaji": "saikou ni waraeru you ni"
    },
    {
      "text": "何万回でも",
      "romaji": "nanmankai demo"
    },
    {
      "text": "は! Try it Try it",
